                                                "example_id": "76cf522a-79c1-47f9-b108-a876c994b5f1",
                                                "sense_id": "d0f54209-641d-31e7-9352-8dfd1e81f766",
                                                "text": "It's a technique, a sort of \"typosquatting,\" that Maly has used repeatedly. A Web site called \"Jobonline.cz\" was registered last March and two months later Maly bought jobsonline.cz."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04162c32-ec21-4393-a8fe-8ab747fd54af",
                                                "sense_id": "d0f54209-641d-31e7-9352-8dfd1e81f766",
                                                "text": "The decline in traditional, direct cybersquatting was accompanied by a rise in a form of indirect cybersquatting known as typosquatting. A typosquatter attempts to cash in on the traffic generated by high-volume Web sites."
